 'Triangle has A(0, 0), B(4, 4), C(8, 0). Which description fits it completely?', 0,
 '[
   {"text": "Right angled AND isosceles", "feedback": "Correct."},
   {"text": "Equilateral, with all three sides equal", "feedback": "AC is 8 but the other two sides are √32. Not all three match."},
